    "methodology": "Intervals are [at_ms, next_event_ms), ending at duration_ms. Labels and observations at the same timestamp apply together. Prediction starts unknown until a reply; failed scans preserve state and miss count; only completed scans change predictions. An online-to-offline label transition starts a departure; an already-offline prediction detects it with zero delay. A return before detection is undetected; loss of labels or the trace ending before detection is censored. Delay p50/p95 use nearest-rank quantiles of detected departures only; undetected and censored counts are reported separately. Lab provenance is supplied by the recorder, not verified by this tool.",
